{"id":"n50523-1-10","stage":1,"title":"땀 · 汗","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50523-1-10-1","ko":"웬 땀을 이렇게 많이 흘렸어?","zh":"你怎么会流这么多汗啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"웬","meaning":"怎么会有、哪儿来的（表示意外）","explanation":"웬：怎么会有、哪儿来的（表示意外）","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}},{"text":"땀을","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땀을","audio":"/audio/cf0c748e4dc40e60964b.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"흘렸어?","meaning":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，流淌，淌出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"5","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흘렸어","audio":"/audio/29f7d09e746eae689298.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"怎么会有、哪儿来的（表示意外）","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"怎么会有、哪儿来的（表示意外）","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"4a87f76767f67dcd","term":"땀","zh":"汗","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3","entryId":"50523","definition":"感到热、身体不舒服或紧张时通过皮肤分泌的咸津津的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["땀"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"汗液、眼泪、鼻涕、血、口水等液体从体内排出。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2262915909200e392671.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50523-1-10-2","ko":"좀 전에 팔 굽혀 펴기를 백 개나 했거든.","zh":"刚才我做了整整一百次俯卧撑呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좀","meaning":"稍微、不久（좀 전：刚才）","explanation":"좀：少许、一点；좀 전 合指不久前","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"팔","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}},{"text":"굽혀","meaning":"弯，弯曲","explanation":"굽히다：弯，弯曲；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"굽히다","audio":"/audio/e7abbdd570a407dd5aca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36864","senseId":"1","lemma":"굽히